					"documentation" : "@dev An external method that creates a new avatar and stores it. This\r\n  method doesn't do any checking and should only be called when the\r\n  input data is known to be valid. Will generate both a Creation event\r\n  and a Transfer event.\r\n  Only whitelisted callers can access this\r\n @param _avatarType The avatar type\r\n @param _level The avatar level\r\n @param _experience The avatar experience.\r\n @param _statistics The avatar statistics.\r\n @param _owner The initial owner of this avatar.\r",
